#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""coord - the task store, scheduler and live page behind /coordinate.

Knowledge lives in the project: <project>/.coordinator/<run>/ holds plan.md,
tasks.json and one folder per task. Process state, logs and worktrees live in
~/.coordinator/runs/<run>/. `coord terminate` removes both (the project folder stays
when it holds saved unfinished work) and the task branches; the run branch with its
pull request stays.

Scheduling, merging and the live page are plain code and cost no tokens.
Agents run as separate background `claude -p` sessions.
"""
